  "notes": "Conjugates as くる (irregular): {持|も}ってくる → {持|も}ってきた (past) → {持|も}ってこない (negative) → {持|も}ってきて (te-form).\n\nCONTRAST WITH {持|も}っていく:\n- {持|も}ってくる: to bring (toward the speaker)\n- ⟦{持|も}っていく→持っていく：27431_motteiku⟧: to take (away from the speaker)\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive. Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ for the object being brought.\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{持|も}ってきて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ means someone has already brought something and it is here now.",
